OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy and
OL,6,Fwet with the rain slowly clearing all
OL,7,Fbut the far east by dawn. Turning
OL,8,Fpartly cloudy from the west, but with
OL,9,Fareas of mist, fog and low cloud
OL,10,Fdeveloping. Winds easing. Cold in
OL,11,Fclearer areas as winds ease.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FA cold start with mist, fog
OL,14,Fand low cloud around, this clears to a
OL,15,Ffine and dry day with decent sunny
OL,16,Fspells. Light winds with temperatures
OL,17,Fnear average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
